{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ga-term-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AbilitySystem｜激活与结束流程\nGAS持实际Active/Spec/count/Task与原生执行；GA只持当前激活身份与自己的资源；外部等待订阅原生OnAbilityEnded。\n[[GGYGO_结构_AbilitySystem.canvas|结构]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构#原请求终止|接口]] · [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|主流程]] · [[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|连段流程]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2300,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "life-try",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1｜请求激活\nProcess（玩家输入）／OnSpawn／Boss BT → ASC `TryActivateAbility(Handle)`；GameplayEvent → 原生 `TriggerAbilityFromGameplayEvent`。\nfinal `CanActivateAbility`：原生检查 → ReturnPending期间拒绝输入发起的Try → 组仲裁 → `CanActivateAbilityAdditional`。\n失败 → final `NotifyAbilityFailed`：输入缓冲认领来源，GroupQueued／SwitchReturnPending登记重试许可。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "life-issue",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2｜签发激活身份\n原生PreActivate → `ASC::NotifyAbilityActivated` → GA `IssueActivation`（ASC、Spec、ActivationKey、Serial），开始组准入尝试并登记组，然后才广播原生激活回调。",
      "x": 556,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "life-body",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3｜final ActivateAbility\n`InitializeAbilityActivation(Original)` → 组终裁 `FinalizeAbilityGroupAdmission` → 相机接管与镜头微调 → `ActivateAbilityBody`（默认触发蓝图激活事件）。任一步结束了本次激活，后续不再执行。",
      "x": 1112,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "life-request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4｜请求结束\nGA业务、Task回调、Squad换人或外部调用 → `RequestAbilityEnd(Original, …)` / `RequestAbilityCancel(Original, …)`。\n→ Accepted／NotCurrent／NotCancelable；原生ScopeLock期间延后，执行时重核Original，不作用于后继。原生Cancel同样进入final EndAbility。",
      "x": 1668,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "life-cleanup",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5｜final EndAbility\n锁内交给原生排队；正式结束时先 `CleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination(Context{Original, bWasCancelled})`（派生归还Task／窗口／Mesh／CMC，基类归还相机接管），再原生End；清理期间重复结束不执行。",
      "x": 2224,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "life-ended",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 6｜结束广播\n`ASC::NotifyAbilityEnded`：GA退役激活身份 → 摘除组登记 → 原生减ActiveCount并广播`OnAbilityEnded` → 组空时唤醒排队输入并广播`OnAbilityGroupFreed`。\nBoss BT、Editor观察、Squad按Spec匹配消费；广播内重激活得到新身份。",
      "x": 2780,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "life-e0",
      "fromNode": "life-try",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "life-issue",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Can通过"
    },
